          "assessment": "The complete new record preserves one source-defined Thiamine-HCl monohydrate material for six explicit NBRC reagent occurrences. Both raw spellings remain sourced synonyms. Registry-only identity, SINGLE_INGREDIENT scope and six assigned occurrences are supported; no historical lot equivalence, molecular CAS/formula, parent, supplier, role or partonomy is invented. All six source recipes name 5 mg within multivitamin stocks, so their water, pH and doses correctly remain recipe context. Duplicate checks include ignored files, all maintained owners, frozen 981 payloads and the actual 37 pending coordinator payloads. No existing same-form owner was identified in those inventories. The six new mapping judgments are correctly attributed LLM_SUGGESTION, and the history records the actual author.",
